{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_title", "source_sha256": "dfd1cd7d4953810d878a33d01a46492d843254bbe1226f97984b382959617dfe", "ja": "完璧な『私』", "zh": "完美的“我”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_synopsis", "source_sha256": "82e50710e8321f24a26381bd5713e45a9168c9a9db905609e40b48884077b497", "ja": "最近AIに凝っている律子。仲間との会話で\nAIでなら完璧なアイドルとしての秋月律子\nが見られるかもしれないと考えた律子は、\nプロデューサーにAI律子のライブを提案。\nそんな中、律子にグラビアの仕事がくる。", "zh": "最近迷上AI的律子，在和同伴的交谈中\n想到如果是靠AI，或许就能看到作为完美\n偶像的秋月律子。于是她向制作人\n提议举办AI律子的演出。\n就在这时，律子接到了写真拍摄的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1000_p", "source_sha256": "81c640320e5679efdd26a89250d16acf0afead11bd39e220d97f12ac666112c6", "ja": "（数日後。律子からグラビアの仕事を\n引き受けたいと返事があった）", "zh": "（几天后。律子回复说，她想接下写真工作）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1001_p", "source_sha256": "aff312677655498d233bc26366dcbcd693f23d860f293eb2da06a5a3ada6370d", "ja": "（撮影は、無事終了。ちょうど確認用のデータが\n届いたから、みんなにも見てもらう事になっている）", "zh": "（拍摄顺利结束。确认用的数据正好送到了，所以决定让大家也一起看看。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "cc31a290816be4f921e3adde810b4ec33c16691d651a4ebce9c1970aba486f9b", "ja": "お疲れ様です、遅くなってすみません……！\nあら？　みんなは……？", "zh": "辛苦了，抱歉我来晚了……！  \n咦？大家呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1003_p", "source_sha256": "634f0f4ccd1d21aaa5909cb72df05fcd0f2f5f3b8f1716c219c74ca1e3755b23", "ja": "お疲れ様、律子。さっき、飲み物を\n買ってくるって出てったよ。すぐ戻るんじゃないかな。", "zh": "辛苦了，律子。刚才她说要去买饮料，就出去了。应该很快就回来了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5eb130428eb3e20b33a998633459ac11a05c9089be55ca82e7312fa6cc641279", "ja": "早速だけど、これがデータだ。他のみんなは\nもうチェックしたから、ゆっくり見てくれ。", "zh": "我就直说了，这是数据。其他人都已经确认过了，你慢慢看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "157ec755c1866bb220f1ab9aa14879665f603aa36eed309e34ce84798736d671", "ja": "わかりました。\n……わ、けっこう多そうですね。", "zh": "好的。\n……哇，看起来挺多的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b82cf247311bc4fb394e3881c0b5ef2c859f28a7694dd76a5d3920c3ca8094ba", "ja": "今回の仕事、迷ってたみたいだけど……\n引き受けてくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "这次的工作，你好像犹豫了很久……\n谢谢你还是接下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "eb37ead20778ceed1978ab45ede1b5d1bb28918c59c3b0d7bc591076dfe11f96", "ja": "正直、こういうのは苦手分野なんですけどね……。\nでもまあ、やるって決めたので。", "zh": "说实话，这种事算是我的弱项……  \n不过既然已经决定要做了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "c35c0aed3e0fcbd56e7c80d059c0c131cdd16455e7347725fe0f8c1b3ac72129", "ja": "衣装も、似合ってたかどうかわかりませんけど。\n挑戦した事に意味がある、って思うことにします。", "zh": "服装嘛，也不知道合不合适。\n不过，我决定把挑战本身当作意义所在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1009_p", "source_sha256": "12fdac8c20eda01c502f23f60cc0ff73b843d3546b341f1e02a43c73425d95fe", "ja": "そうか。ひとつ言っておくけど、衣装は\n律子に似合ってたと思うから、心配しなくていいよ。", "zh": "这样啊。不过有句话我得告诉你，我觉得那套服装很适合律子，所以不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "97a7d1db6328e0660ed6e63afc63fc835b80dbea6447888e713631e223667104", "ja": "え？　……もう、{$P$}。\nお世辞はいいですから。", "zh": "诶？……真是的，{$P$}。\n不用说客套话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c898f7c6c19426e073a464000d0260fc0e5c93ca62d65efc07009df00a8c616f", "ja": "いや、お世辞とかじゃなくて……。\n本当に似合ってたんだって。", "zh": "不，我不是在说客套话……\n是真的非常适合你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "f52eec99747d4d75761b72d49f0c4cd6e8afd75637e92d6b0f3a574163fef7eb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\nあら、律子さん。もう取材終わったんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～。\n哎呀，律子。采访已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "83930fdb889e6d6e240c84c118f6bf659370a8f849cbcb6c3e3f2fbadc46b264", "ja": "り、律子さん……写真、見ましたか……？\n衣装がとっても、似合ってて……す、素敵でした……♪", "zh": "律、律子小姐……你看过照片了吗……？\n服装非常适合你……真、真好看……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "7b29cb54819695f142ac512b04b7e699a2fb25e98b143229fed14d83807b8d53", "ja": "ええ、本当によく似合ってました～。律子さんの\nファンの子豚ちゃんも、きっと喜ぶことでしょう～♪", "zh": "是的，真的非常合适呢～律子小姐的\n粉丝小猪们肯定也会很高兴的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1015_p", "source_sha256": "67f31b3039ca77ea3d6ce2514e16b75ed79e5c1b1b8983693f19a1aae040a804", "ja": "ほら。\nみんなも、こう言ってるじゃないか。", "zh": "你看。\n大家不也都这么说吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "9687ebe1652534f1b2739be4e95343e26c620185a6f4ee855d7c6d3960bffff1", "ja": "……。\nみんな……本気でそう思ってる？", "zh": "……。\n大家……真的都是这么想的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "7865c97bb2f19118f3d01f822732c1d501e24aa0e47c01b7fcba4d7a5f85eb81", "ja": "私らが律子にお世辞なんか言うてもしゃあないやろ？\nメッチャ似合ってたで！", "zh": "我们给律子说什么奉承话也没用吧？真的特别适合你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1018_p", "source_sha256": "678756964d8ab63ac0fe44b7da1478a5ad2580706e9516cc31ae5e3c326cc71f", "ja": "な？　律子にピッタリな衣装だと思ったんだ。", "zh": "对吧？我就觉得这是非常适合律子的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "25d64066d36aa237414358e4e2622a145554f857c392a59b020e54978afc8362", "ja": "流石、{$P$}さんの目は\n確かですね～。", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}先生，眼光果然很准呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "343d1c63592ad4becf15d159c075219dd635d90bc9c6c82d89dbbd1601befa32", "ja": "……。\n私に、ピッタリ……。", "zh": "……。\n很适合我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "c03e030eebadb2b1677dd29a5aed5060a8a3bd80d6b6616f6a858d88132d51a2", "ja": "そっか……そうなんですね……。\nやっぱり、一番『私』を知っていてくれるのは……。", "zh": "原来如此……是这样啊……\n果然，最了解“我”的人就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "ae5fa6a00ff098b15eb82d3a2a44c0285bd8bb58826fef564aae66bb06a8bb58", "ja": "いえ、何でもありません。\n……それより、{$P$}殿？", "zh": "不，没什么。\n……比起这个，{$P$}殿下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "a0a15a3cf0db091e0454aa98e590e1c70d5a0c6fd129bf5f7015b9ef03cd7b05", "ja": "今回のグラビアって、好評だったんですよね。\nちゃんと、次の仕事のオファーに繋がりそうですか？", "zh": "这次的写真拍摄反响很好，对吧。\n应该能顺利接到下一份工作邀约吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0d424b6b7079f994ba108c08426bddb9cd90e665372f7b53327a27b03fa22528", "ja": "もちろん！　みんなの頑張りは、ちゃんと\n繋げていくよ。期待して待っててくれ！", "zh": "当然了！大家的努力，我一定会\n好好转化成新的机会。你就满怀期待地等着吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "0420bbf4e512d09639878652ad344897d56c21d7b3ce4592172618048c92d27d", "ja": "……。貴方は、『完璧な秋月律子』だけど。\nそれって、『私』じゃなかったみたい。", "zh": "……。你虽然是“完美的秋月律子”，\n但那好像并不是“我”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "efa3f4555f4587395a2ff4e4d56c2cceb4d564735437041746825d1a517c44bc", "ja": "【……何が違うのかしら？】", "zh": "【……到底有什么不同呢？】", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "51017e0e9d4448ec49303d0169c2f7ab745d759284f586b9dcfec90551bd47f5", "ja": "そうね……。私が本当にやりたいことを\n知ってるのは、『私』……ってことかしら。", "zh": "是啊……真正知道我想做什么的，\n就是“我”……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "4e8b4b9cff430bad4f3961e45ddd57fb2fab1e3a140a26582fa2bb585f7036b1", "ja": "あとは、プロデューサーね。\n悔しいけど、私より私のことを知ってるのかも。", "zh": "还有，就是制作人了吧。\n虽然很不甘心，但他可能比我还要了解我自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "95c9c2bf75a198d078e0b83bdfffe188ccb735491b133d0a9e281317917704ad", "ja": "【何を言ってるの？\n『秋月律子』を一番よく知っているのは、この私よ】", "zh": "【你在说什么？\n“最了解‘秋月律子’的人，就是我。”】", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "ba3cdd287fb83b520932c1c89284aaa62fcd5217a753bec15ccc0bbc931c25e9", "ja": "うん。……そう言い切れる時点で、\n貴方は私じゃないってこと。", "zh": "嗯……能如此断言的话，就说明你不是我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_156_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "68ea3d7f5ef93ed46b26aea5b4e904c354ef7545ddf95920c39da9cceaf7d8fd", "ja": "だから……ここでお別れね。\n……さようなら。", "zh": "所以……我们就此告别吧。\n……再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
